{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapped. Isolated. Losing control.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Nora, a brilliant scientist who wakes up locked inside the Research Center she once called home. But she\u2019s not alone\u2014her colleague Victor has turned against her, sealing every exit and injecting her with a mysterious toxin. As the substance courses through her veins, her mind grows clouded. The only way out? Solve Victor\u2019s intricate puzzles before the toxin takes full control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through a series of challenging, mind-bending puzzles, uncover the dark secrets behind the research facility, and outsmart Victor\u2019s deadly traps. Can you escape before you lose yourself completely?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Puzzle Mechanics \u2013 Solve a variety of intricate puzzles that test your logic, memory, and problem-solving skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling Storyline \u2013 Piece together the mystery behind Victor\u2019s mysterious toxin.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Environment \u2013 Explore a haunting research center filled with cryptic clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time \u2013 There is no time limit. Play at your own pace (~4-6 hours on average)!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape\u2026 or lose yourself forever.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Escaped and Cured!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463750/c87eaf12a0903dd349c4b4d4887ae99789c9ba3d.jpg"},{"name":"Escaped?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463750/e061a24086f7e2451e49d8616b5b002bd6581584.jpg"},{"name":"Solved!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3463750/476abfa1918628a3f40b6f5ea7fe7ddde0c46c39.jpg"},{"name":"One Bl